  <running_head>MATERIA / TARUM.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="2" para="true">LIBR. 2. TIT. 2.</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">De Rebus corporalibus &amp; Incorporalibus.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">1. <i>Res corporales describuntur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">2. <i>Res incorporales definiuntur, ea-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>rumque exempla traduntur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" para="true">3. <i>Sunt quaedam res incorporales, quae ta-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>men non sunt huius ordinis.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" para="true">4. <i>Moribus aliter atque jure Romano res</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>dividuntur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">5. <i>Quid statutorum scriptores intelligant</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>per mobilia &amp; immobilia, docetur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">6. <i>Quanam mobilibus vel immobilibus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>sint annumeranda prolixe declaratur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" type="heading" level="1" caput="3" para="true">LIBR. 2. TIT. 3.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">De Servit. Rustic. &amp; Urban. Prad.</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">1. <i>Cognito genere demum probè</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>cognoscuntur species.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">2. <i>Servitus rei cum persona servitute</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>comparatur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">3. <i>Traditur definitio servitutis.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">4. <i>Servitutum divisio explicatur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">5. <i>Praedia ab usu seu materiâ sunt deno-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>minanda.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">6. <i>An moribus venatio in alieno sit jus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>servitutis?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" type="heading" level="2" para="true">In Princ.</l>
    <l n="27" para="true">1. <i>Servitutum rusticarum species enar-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>rantur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29" para="true">2. <i>Quid sit iter?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="30" para="true">3. <i>Quid actus?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="31" para="true">4. <i>Quid via?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="32" para="true">5. <i>Quid aquaductus?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="33" para="true">6. <i>An recte per causam artificialem duca-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="34">
      <i>tur?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="35" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 1.</l>
    <l n="36" para="true">1. <i>Quid sint praediorum urbanorum ser</i>
    </l>
    <l n="37">2. Quid oneris ferendi servitus? 3.</l>
    <l n="38">Quid Tigni immittendi?</l>
    <l n="39">4. Quid Projicendi &amp; protegendi? 5. Quid</l>
    <l n="40">Stillicidii? 6. Quid fluminis?</l>
    <l n="41">7. Qualis sit non altius tollendi servitus?</l>
    <l n="42">8. Quales &amp; quot servitutes de lumini-</l>
    <l n="43">bus?</l>
    <l n="44" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 2.</l>
    <l n="45" para="true">1. Quaedam servitutes sint communes?</l>
    <l n="46">2. Aqua haustus quid sit?</l>
    <l n="47">3. Quid pecoris ad aquam appulsus? 4.</l>
    <l n="48">Quid pecoris pascendi servitus.</l>
    <l n="49">5. Quid servitus calcis coquendae, &amp;</l>
    <l n="50">arenae fodiendae?</l>
    <l n="51" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 3.</l>
    <l n="52" para="true">
      <i>Servitutes sine praediis constitui</i>
    </l>
    <l n="53">
      <i>non possunt, &amp; non nisi à domino.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="54" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 4.</l>
    <l n="55" para="true">1. Causa servitutum proponuntur.</l>
    <l n="56">2. Regulariter vicinis servitutes constitu-</l>
    <l n="57">untur.</l>
    <l n="58">3. Et quidem conventionibus.</l>
    <l n="59">4. Etiam ultimâ voluntate.</l>
    <l n="60">5. Et aliis modis.</l>
    <l n="61">6. Non tamen ex tempore vel conditione.</l>
    <l n="62">7. Adquiruntur servitutes longo tempore.</l>
    <l n="63">8. Modi quibus finiuntur enumerantur.</l>
    <l n="64" type="heading" level="1" caput="2" para="true">LIBR. 2. INSTIT. TIT. 4.</l>
    <l n="65" type="heading" level="1" caput="2">De Usufructu.</l>
    <l n="66" type="heading" level="2" para="true">In Princ.</l>
    <l n="67" para="true">1. DEfinitur usufructus.</l>
    <l n="68">2. Non satis accurate dividitur in</l>
    <l n="69">causalem &amp; formalem.</l>
    <l n="70">3. Cautio fructuaria explicatur. 4. Non recte dividitur</l>
    <l n="71">usufructus in verum &amp; quasi.</l>
    <l n="72" para="true">* * *</l>
    <l n="73" para="true">4. Mo-</l>
